    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-Replace Ecommerce Cart Merge-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API facilitates the seamless consolidation of shopping cart items from multiple sessions, enhancing the customer experience by ensuring that users retain their selected products across devices. This API allows e-commerce platforms to merge the contents of different carts based on user identification. Typical consumers of this API include online retail developers looking to improve user engagement and cart recovery strategies. By leveraging this API, businesses can reduce cart abandonment and optimize their sales processes.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
